Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:16:17 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] velox: skip unnecessary DeviceOpTracker waitable and yield on
 fence submit/reset (patch 0026)

---
 host/vulkan/device_op_tracker.cpp       |  62 ++++++++------
 host/vulkan/device_op_tracker.h         |   3 +
 host/vulkan/vk_decoder_global_state.cpp | 104 +++++++++++++++---------
 host/vulkan/vulkan_boxed_handles.cpp    |   8 ++
 host/vulkan/vulkan_boxed_handles.h      |   2 +
 5 files changed, 115 insertions(+), 64 deletions(-)

diff --git a/host/vulkan/device_op_tracker.cpp b/host/vulkan/device_op_tracker.cpp
